//   Live Classroom aggregate).
//
// Owning domain  : Content Delivery (chora_delivery database)
// Owning team    : Team 2 (Delivery)
// Topic prefix   : chora.delivery.live_quiz_session.*
//
// A LiveQuizSession is one host-led run of a published LiveQuiz. Per ADR-168
// the realtime hot path (per-vote tallies + live leaderboard) rides a Redis
// backplane and is NEVER published as a domain event. Only these DURABLE
// lifecycle + scoring events flow onto Pub/Sub for cross-domain consumers:
//
//   - started      : session went LIVE (instructor opened the room)
//   - score_awarded : one graded answer credited cumulative points — consumed
//                     by chora-sharing's leaderboard.Ranker (Three-Currency XP
//                     economy). This is the load-bearing cross-domain event.
//   - ended        : session CLOSED (final results frozen)
//
// Cross-domain references (no FK):
//   - gcid (envelope) : Identity — the learner (score_awarded) / instructor
//                       (started/ended) actor. UUIDv7, no FK.
//   - live_quiz_id    : the published LiveQuiz template (same DB).
// =============================================================================

